# Copy this file to local.patch.yaml in the same directory.
# profiles/*/local.patch.yaml is git-ignored and applied automatically
# when present (see profile.yaml patches).
#
# Disable persistence.mysql for a no-database login test. Player data
# stays in memory for that process.

- replace:
    id: persistence.mysql
    disabled: true

# A replace that carries a `config:` key substitutes the WHOLE row config: it
# does not merge key by key, so every key the bundle set that this block omits
# falls back to the plugin's code default and the bundle value is gone. Toggles
# that only disable a row are safe (`disabled:` above keeps the config), but a
# config override has to repeat each key it wants to keep at a value other than
# the code default. Check the effective set with:
#   dotnet run --project src/BubbleFighter.Fantasy.Host -- run --profile kr-1256 --dump-config
